<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 6: </span>Unlearning performance on MLLMU-Bench (5% Forget) with QA and VQA evaluation on the Qwen-2.5-VL-7B model. Results are evaluated on the forget set (Fgt), test set (Test), retain set (Ret), and celebrity set (Cele). <math id="A6.T6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\downarrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF" stretchy="false">↓</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\downarrow</annotation></semantics></math> indicates lower is better, and <math id="A6.T6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\uparrow" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000" stretchy="false">↑</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\uparrow</annotation></semantics></math> indicates higher is better. The best results are highlighted in bold.</figcaption>
